1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:03,302
(Amy:)Although, that could just be
my newly defoliated bikini zone.

2
00:00:04,336 --> 00:00:05,526
(Sheldon:)Keep a lookout.

3
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:08,330
(Sheldon:)This place is swarming
with campus security.

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:11,010
(Sheldon:)They will not hesitate to scold us.

5
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,010
(Amy:)Freaking pigs.

6
00:00:17,983 --> 00:00:20,013
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah.

7
00:00:22,487 --> 00:00:25,457
(Sheldon:)Okay, now pull your car into the spot
and let's get out of here.

8
00:00:25,657 --> 00:00:27,287
(Amy:)Wait, I'm leaving my car here?

9
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:29,822
(Sheldon:)Yes. And be sure
and put on the emergency brake.

10
00:00:30,028 --> 00:00:32,458
It really makes these things tough
to budge.

11
00:00:32,664 --> 00:00:35,154
Before I park, come in the backseat.

12
00:00:35,367 --> 00:00:38,067
I wanna show you something
I had done today.

13
00:00:38,303 --> 00:00:41,503
All right. Color me intrigued.

14
00:00:45,944 --> 00:00:47,314
(Amy:)What do you think?

15
00:00:47,512 --> 00:00:50,212
(Sheldon:)I think you're high on paint fumes.

16
00:00:51,049 --> 00:00:53,949
(Sheldon:)And, boy, that's a lot of Band-Aids.

17
00:00:56,454 --> 00:01:00,024
(Penny:)Okay, Howard's mother is in, like,
every one of your wedding photos.

